WEBVTT

00:00:02.208 --> 00:00:05.166
We've been running all night, NK.

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:07.750
Can't we take a break?

00:00:07.833 --> 00:00:11.291
Be quiet, miscreant!
We're almost there.

00:00:13.208 --> 00:00:15.750
Oh! We're never gonna make it!

00:00:17.166 --> 00:00:20.416
Behold! My contingency plan.

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:25.000
Do you see the Nightmare King?

00:00:25.083 --> 00:00:28.333
Not yet, but-- Hey! Look who it is!

00:00:32.416 --> 00:00:34.250
Good to see ya, little bro!

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:36.458
Looks like he has some new friends.

00:00:36.541 --> 00:00:37.958
More like family.

00:00:38.041 --> 00:00:40.208
I have to say, Izzie,
that thing is super cool.

00:00:40.291 --> 00:00:43.041
What's not super cool
is the Nightmare King.

00:00:43.125 --> 00:00:44.916
He's been trying to steal these eggs,

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.333
but Sharky-Tank and I were able
to drive him off.

00:00:48.416 --> 00:00:50.625
We're hot on his tail right now!

00:00:50.708 --> 00:00:53.250
Why didn't you just call us?

00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:55.333
Our Dreamy Screamy got smashed.

00:00:55.416 --> 00:00:59.083
And it's not the only thing
about to get smashed. Hop on!

00:01:09.291 --> 00:01:10.791
What do you think’s inside them?

00:01:10.875 --> 00:01:14.041
Uh, my bet? Nothing good.

00:01:14.125 --> 00:01:17.083
Actually, whatever I want
there to be.

00:01:17.166 --> 00:01:21.666
But the eggs you took from me,
they were special.

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:25.083
Eggs that had absorbed
the true essence of the Dream World.

00:01:25.166 --> 00:01:28.708
Eggs with great potential
inside them,

00:01:28.791 --> 00:01:31.000
which you turned against me!

00:01:31.083 --> 00:01:34.750
But even their powers are no match
for the hordes

00:01:34.833 --> 00:01:37.708
I will unleash to reclaim them!

00:01:45.208 --> 00:01:48.583
There's no hope for you now,
Dream Chasers!

00:01:48.666 --> 00:01:50.541
No hope at all!

00:02:01.208 --> 00:02:04.208
Dream Chasers! Chase!

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:20.541
All right, buddy,
let's just roll with it!

00:02:49.166 --> 00:02:51.416
Nightmare King!
You aren't going to win this!

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:54.041
Oh, we'll see about that!

00:02:54.125 --> 00:02:56.375
Let's end this, Dream Chaser!

00:02:56.458 --> 00:02:58.625
Finally something we agree on!

